there is one root with \(\mu=B\) and

\[
 \Delta_P=d(e-1)=\alpha\beta B^2-\alpha B.
\]

Therefore

\[
 \boxed{R_P=B^2-\frac{B}{\beta}\longrightarrow\infty.}             \tag{1.5}
